{"id":"n15831-4-7","stage":2,"title":"스치다 · 扫过","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15831-4-7-1","ko":"오늘 모임에 네가 좋아한다는 사람도 왔어?","zh":"今天聚会里，那个你说喜欢的人也来了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"모임에","meaning":"聚会","explanation":"모임：聚会；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"모임","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61519","senseId":"1","lemma":"모임","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모임에","audio":"/audio/9b4c76c72e07467e4dae.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아한다는","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；ㄴ다는：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아한다는","audio":"/audio/fc8b2c8b30910672c37c.mp3"}},{"text":"사람도","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람도","audio":"/audio/4649bb7a958f6a2944cc.mp3"}},{"text":"왔어?","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왔어","audio":"/audio/1c7a0c0d37b0eadd46f3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"2485fc53da01e9d6","term":"모임","zh":"聚会","audio":"/audio/2485fc53da01e9d64bb6.mp3","entryId":"61519","definition":"多人为做某事而聚在一起的行为。","pronunciation":["모임"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6f87d09ed261ab623994.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15831-4-7-2","ko":"응, 그런데 나한테는 눈길도 스치지 않더라.","zh":"嗯，可是他连看我一眼都没看呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"그런데","meaning":"可是，但是","explanation":"그런데：可是，但是","readings":[{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70717","senseId":"2","lemma":"그런데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그런데","audio":"/audio/30c94182141ace2fd889.mp3"}},{"text":"나한테는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。；는：